→ $$-y$$ 곱하기 3은 얼마인가요? → 곱한 값들을 합치세요\n정답: $$-y^2-3y$$","tags":["6.3 다항식 곱하기","다항식을 단항식과 곱하기","OATutor","CC BY 4.0"],"source_name":"OpenStax: Elementary Algebra 2e / OATutor","source_author":"OpenStax and OATutor Project","source_url":"https://github.com/CAHLR/OATutor-Content","license":"CC BY 4.0","attribution":"Problem content adapted from OpenStax Elementary Algebra 2e; hints and scaffolds by the OATutor Project. Licensed under CC BY 4.0."},{"code":"oatutor-a012999exa28a","subject":"수학","unit":"6.3 다항식 곱하기","problem_type":"계산형","difficulty":"보통","question":"$$-x(x-10)$$","hint":"바깥의 값을 안쪽 괄호 안의 각 값에 곱하세요","answer":"$$-x^2+10x$$","explanation":"해결 단계: 바깥의 값을 안쪽 괄호 안의 각 값에 곱하세요 → $$-x$$와 $$x$$를 곱하면 무엇인가요? → $$-x$$와 -10을 곱하면 무엇인가요? → 곱한 값들을 합치세요\n정답: $$-x^2+10x$$","tags":["6.3 다항식 곱하기","다항식에 단항식을 곱하기","OATutor","CC BY 4.0"],"source_name":"OpenStax: Elementary Algebra 2e / OATutor","source_author":"OpenStax and OATutor Project","source_url":"https://github.com/CAHLR/OATutor-Content","license":"CC BY 4.0","attribution":"Problem content adapted from OpenStax Elementary Algebra 2e; hints and scaffolds by the OATutor Project. Licensed under CC BY 4.0."},{"code":"oatutor-a012999exa29a","subject":"수학","unit":"6.3 다항식 곱하기","problem_type":"계산형","difficulty":"보통","question":"$$-p(p-15)$$","hint":"바깥의 값을 안쪽 괄호 안의 각 값에 곱하세요","answer":"$$-p^2+15p$$","explanation":"해결 단계: 바깥의 값을 안쪽 괄호 안의 각 값에 곱하세요 → $$-p$$와 $$p$$를 곱하면 무엇인가요? → $$-p$$와 -15를 곱하면 무엇인가요? → 곱한 값들을 합치세요\n정답: $$-p^2+15p$$","tags":["6.3 다항식 곱하기","다항식에 단항식을 곱하기","OATutor","CC BY 4.0"],"source_name":"OpenStax: Elementary Algebra 2e / OATutor","source_author":"OpenStax and OATutor Project","source_url":"https://github.com/CAHLR/OATutor-Content","license":"CC BY 4.0","attribution":"Problem content adapted from OpenStax Elementary Algebra 2e; hints and scaffolds by the OATutor Project. Licensed under CC BY 4.0."},{"code":"oatutor-a012999exa3a","subject":"수학","unit":"6.3 다항식 곱하기","problem_type":"계산형","difficulty":"보통","question